# Design

See also: `docs/009_UI_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`, `docs/011_DESIGN_TOKEN.md`

## Brand

- Name signal: **GVG / Global Vista Group** must be hero-level on marketing surfaces
- Product: Global Trade OS
- Tone: confident, global, operational — not playful startup kitsch

## Tokens (`styles/globals.css`)

- Ink navy `#0a1628` · Teal accent `#1a7a6d` · Copper `#b87333` (sparingly)
- Mist / surface neutrals for content regions
- Display font: Outfit · Body: Source Sans 3

## Layout

- One composition in the first viewport
- Full-bleed heroes on promotional pages
- One job per section
- Cards only when interaction needs a container — never in heroes
- No detached badges/stickers over hero media

## Motion

Ship 2–3 intentional motions max per visually led surface; disable transforms when `prefers-reduced-motion`.
